  "deterministic_verifier_questions": [
    "Do all deployments satisfy terrain, occupancy, cost and the eight-slot limit in the stated same-frame order?",
    "Do actual pioneer grants occur before the purchases and withdrawals that depend on them?",
    "Do opening damage and healing preserve both pioneers and complete Melantha's obligations before frame 1860?",
    "Do actual artillery locks, healing targets and attack intervals preserve both physicians and the two patrol casters?",
    "Is the patrol dead before frame 3840 without unsupported splash or targeting talents?",
    "Are all four devices actually destroyed before their responsible operators withdraw, with both civilians surviving and arriving?",
    "Do final armor and raider overlaps remain within blocking capacity until the complete WIN predicate holds?"
